$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=ppilb3lem2  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for ppilb3: the prime number theorem unpacked at epsilon = 1/2.


1::elioore |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> x e. RR )

2::eliooord |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( 1 < x /\ x < +oo ) )
3:2:simpld  |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> 1 < x )
4:1,3:rplogcld |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( log ` x ) e. RR+ )
5::0lt1     |- 0 < 1
6:5:a1i     |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> 0 < 1 )
7::0re      |- 0 e. RR
8:7:a1i     |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> 0 e. RR )
9::1re      |- 1 e. RR
10:9:a1i    |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> 1 e. RR )
11:8,10,1,6,3:lttrd |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> 0 < x )
12:1,11:elrpd |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> x e. RR+ )
13:12,4:rpdivcld |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( x / ( log ` x ) ) e. RR+ )
14a::ppicl
14:1,14a:syl |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( ppi ` x ) e. NN0 )
15:14:nn0red |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( ppi ` x ) e. RR )
16:15,13:rerpdivcld |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) -> ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) e. RR )
17:16:rgen  |- A. x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) e. RR
18:17:a1i   |- ( T. -> A. x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) e. RR )
19::halfre  |- ( 1 / 2 ) e. RR
20::halfgt0 |- 0 < ( 1 / 2 )
21:19,20: |- ( 1 / 2 ) e. RR+
22:21:a1i   |- ( T. -> ( 1 / 2 ) e. RR+ )
23::pnt     |- ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) |-> ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) ) ~~>r 1
24:23:a1i   |- ( T. -> ( x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) |-> ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) ) ~~>r 1 )
25:18,22,24:rlimi |- ( T. -> E. y e. RR A. x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) ( y <_ x -> ( abs ` ( ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) - 1 ) ) < ( 1 / 2 ) ) )
qed:25:mptru |- E. y e. RR A. x e. ( 1 (,) +oo ) ( y <_ x -> ( abs ` ( ( ( ppi ` x ) / ( x / ( log ` x ) ) ) - 1 ) ) < ( 1 / 2 ) )
